<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HAMBURG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HAMBURG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals in the Hamburg Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi ( Morocco) 4-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Tommy Haas (Germany) beat 11-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 2-6 6-3 6-3.  </p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov(Russia) beat Albert Costa (Spain) 6-3 6-0.  </p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov(Russia) beat Albert Costa (Spain) 6-3 6-0 Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 12-Sergei Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 7-6 (7-3).</p>
</text>
